coaligned temple (and are in good standing with your god) as opposed to at
a plain old altar, you won't be able to fight the opponent in the same
room as the altar unless they're summoned or teleported in. It's as if the
room had Elbereth written on every square, so most hostile creatures won't
enter.

(ObUncertainty: Does this change if the priest has been killed or
